  {
   "id": "matematicas-2011-reserva-4-5",
   "n": 5,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "En una empresa los ingresos (en euros) dependen de la edad. Si la edad, \\(x\\), es de 18 a 50 años, los ingresos vienen dados por la fórmula \\(-x^2+70x\\), mientras que para edades iguales o superiores a 50 años los ingresos están determinados por la expresión \\(\\dfrac{400x}{x-30}\\). Calcula cuál es el máximo de los ingresos y a qué edad se alcanza.",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[I(x)=\\begin{cases}-x^2+70x&\\text{si }18\\le x\\lt50\\\\\\dfrac{400x}{x-30}&\\text{si }x\\ge50\\end{cases}\\]<p>Es continua en \\(x=50\\): los dos trozos valen \\(1000\\). Estudiamos el signo de \\(I'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>; \\(x=50\\) es punto «problemático» (cambia la expresión)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Los puntos «problemáticos» son los que no pertenecen al dominio (por ejemplo, los que anulan un denominador) y los puntos donde cambia la expresión de una función a trozos. Hay que marcarlos en la recta porque en ellos también puede cambiar el signo de la derivada.</i>.</p>\\[I'(x)=\\begin{cases}-2x+70&\\text{si }18\\lt x\\lt50\\\\\\dfrac{400(x-30)-400x}{(x-30)^2}=\\dfrac{-12000}{(x-30)^2}&\\text{si }x\\gt50\\end{cases}\\qquad-2x+70=0\\iff\\boxed{x=35}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 284 108' width='100%' style='max-width:341px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H270' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>18</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>35</text><path d='M188 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='188' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>50</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M65.0 40L101.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 11L101.0 10L99.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>I</tspan>′(20) &gt; 0</text><text x='125.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M139.0 10L175.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M166.0 39L175.0 40L173.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='151.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>I</tspan>′(40) &lt; 0</text><text x='203.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M217.0 10L253.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M244.0 39L253.0 40L251.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='229.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>I</tspan>′(60) &lt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(I\\) crece en \\((18,35)\\) debido a que \\(I'(x)\\gt0\\) y decrece a partir de 35 debido a que \\(I'(x)\\lt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>: el máximo está en \\(x=35\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>, con \\(I(35)=-1225+2450=1225\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='33.7,65.7 35.5,63.7 37.3,61.8 39.2,60.0 41.0,58.2 42.8,56.5 44.6,54.8 46.5,53.2 48.3,51.7 50.1,50.2 51.9,48.8 53.8,47.5 55.6,46.2 57.4,45.0 59.2,43.8 61.1,42.7 62.9,41.7 64.7,40.7 66.5,39.8 68.4,39.0 70.2,38.2 72.0,37.5 73.8,36.9 75.6,36.3 77.5,35.7 79.3,35.3 81.1,34.9 82.9,34.5 84.8,34.3 86.6,34.1 88.4,33.9 90.2,33.8 92.1,33.8 93.9,33.8 95.7,33.9 97.5,34.1 99.4,34.3 101.2,34.6 103.0,35.0 104.8,35.4 106.7,35.9 108.5,36.4 110.3,37.0 112.1,37.7 114.0,38.4 115.8,39.2 117.6,40.1 119.4,41.0 121.3,42.0 123.1,43.0 124.9,44.1 126.7,45.3 128.6,46.5 130.4,47.8 132.2,49.2 134.0,50.6 135.9,52.1 137.7,53.6 139.5,55.2 141.3,56.9 143.2,58.6' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='143.2,58.6 145.4,60.8 147.7,62.8 150.0,64.6 152.3,66.4 154.6,68.1 156.8,69.7 159.1,71.1 161.4,72.6 163.7,73.9 166.0,75.2 168.2,76.4 170.5,77.5 172.8,78.6 175.1,79.7 177.4,80.7 179.6,81.6 181.9,82.6 184.2,83.4 186.5,84.3 188.8,85.1 191.1,85.9 193.3,86.6 195.6,87.4 197.9,88.0 200.2,88.7 202.5,89.4 204.7,90.0 207.0,90.6 209.3,91.2 211.6,91.7 213.9,92.3 216.1,92.8 218.4,93.3 220.7,93.8 223.0,94.3 225.3,94.7 227.5,95.2 229.8,95.6 232.1,96.0 234.4,96.5 236.7,96.9 238.9,97.2 241.2,97.6 243.5,98.0 245.8,98.3 248.1,98.7 250.4,99.0 252.6,99.4 254.9,99.7 257.2,100.0 259.5,100.3 261.8,100.6 264.0,100.9 266.3,101.2 268.6,101.5 270.9,101.7 273.2,102.0 275.4,102.3 277.7,102.5 280.0,102.8' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='91.8' cy='33.8' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='97.8' y='27.8'>máx (35, 1225)</text><circle cx='143.2' cy='58.6' r='3.5' fill='0'/><text x='143.2' y='52.6'></text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 169.0H294.0M-27.9 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='40.5' y1='166.0' x2='40.5' y2='172.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='37.5' y='183.0' font-size='10'>20</text><line x1='91.8' y1='166.0' x2='91.8' y2='172.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='88.8' y='183.0' font-size='10'>35</text><line x1='143.2' y1='166.0' x2='143.2' y2='172.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='140.2' y='183.0' font-size='10'>50</text><line x1='211.6' y1='166.0' x2='211.6' y2='172.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='208.6' y='183.0' font-size='10'>70</text><line x1='280.0' y1='166.0' x2='280.0' y2='172.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='277.0' y='183.0' font-size='10'>90</text><line x1='-30.9' y1='113.8' x2='-24.9' y2='113.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='-43.9' y='117.8' font-size='10'>500</text><line x1='-30.9' y1='58.6' x2='-24.9' y2='58.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='-43.9' y='62.6' font-size='10'>1000</text></svg></div><div class='res'>El ingreso máximo es de 1225 €, a los 35 años</div></div>"
    }
   ],
