  {
   "id": "matematicas-2011-reserva-4-6",
   "n": 6,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Dada la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=-2x^2+3x-1\\)",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,5 p.) Prueba que las rectas \\(y=-x+1\\) e \\(y=3x-1\\) son tangentes a su gráfica.",
     "(2 p.) Halla el área del recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\) y las rectas mencionadas en el apartado anterior."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Una recta es tangente a una parábola si al igualarlas sale una raíz doble<i class='n' data-t='why'>Recta y parábola se tocan en un solo punto, sin cruzarse.</i>:</p>\\[-2x^2+3x-1=-x+1\\iff2x^2-4x+2=0\\iff(x-1)^2=0:\\ \\text{tangente en }(1,0)\\]\\[-2x^2+3x-1=3x-1\\iff2x^2=0:\\ \\text{tangente en }(0,-1)\\]<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Con derivadas: \\(f'(1)=-1\\) y \\(f'(0)=3\\), las pendientes de las rectas ✓.</i><div class='res'>Las dos rectas son tangentes: \\(y=-x+1\\) en \\(x=1\\) e \\(y=3x-1\\) en \\(x=0\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Las tangentes se cortan en \\(-x+1=3x-1\\iff x=\\frac12\\). El recinto va de 0 a 1, con las rectas por encima de la parábola:</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='74.7,141.6 77.0,138.4 79.3,135.2 81.6,132.0 83.9,128.8 86.1,125.6 88.4,122.4 90.7,119.2 93.0,116.0 95.3,112.8 97.5,109.6 99.8,106.4 102.1,103.2 104.4,100.0 106.7,96.8 108.9,93.6 111.2,90.4 113.5,87.2 115.8,84.0 118.1,80.8 120.4,77.6 122.6,74.4 124.9,71.2 127.2,68.0 129.5,64.8 131.8,61.6 134.0,58.4 136.3,55.2 138.6,52.0 140.9,48.8 143.2,45.6 145.4,46.7 147.7,47.7 150.0,48.8 152.3,49.9 154.6,50.9 156.8,52.0 159.1,53.1 161.4,54.1 163.7,55.2 166.0,56.3 168.2,57.3 170.5,58.4 172.8,59.5 175.1,60.5 177.4,61.6 179.6,62.7 181.9,63.7 184.2,64.8 186.5,65.9 188.8,66.9 191.1,68.0 193.3,69.1 195.6,70.1 197.9,71.2 200.2,72.3 202.5,73.3 204.7,74.4 207.0,75.5 209.3,76.5 211.6,77.6 211.6,77.6 209.3,76.6 207.0,75.6 204.7,74.7 202.5,73.9 200.2,73.2 197.9,72.5 195.6,71.9 193.3,71.3 191.1,70.9 188.8,70.5 186.5,70.2 184.2,69.9 181.9,69.7 179.6,69.6 177.4,69.6 175.1,69.6 172.8,69.7 170.5,69.9 168.2,70.2 166.0,70.5 163.7,70.9 161.4,71.3 159.1,71.9 156.8,72.5 154.6,73.2 152.3,73.9 150.0,74.7 147.7,75.6 145.4,76.6 143.2,77.6 140.9,78.7 138.6,79.9 136.3,81.1 134.0,82.4 131.8,83.8 129.5,85.3 127.2,86.8 124.9,88.4 122.6,90.1 120.4,91.8 118.1,93.6 115.8,95.5 113.5,97.5 111.2,99.5 108.9,101.6 106.7,103.8 104.4,106.0 102.1,108.3 99.8,110.7 97.5,113.2 95.3,115.7 93.0,118.3 90.7,120.9 88.4,123.7 86.1,126.5 83.9,129.4 81.6,132.3 79.3,135.3 77.0,138.4 74.7,141.6' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='47.4,185.1 51.0,178.7 54.7,172.5 58.3,166.5 62.0,160.6 65.6,155.0 69.3,149.5 72.9,144.2 76.6,139.1 80.2,134.1 83.9,129.4 87.5,124.8 91.2,120.4 94.8,116.2 98.5,112.2 102.1,108.3 105.8,104.7 109.4,101.2 113.1,97.9 116.7,94.8 120.4,91.8 124.0,89.1 127.6,86.5 131.3,84.1 134.9,81.9 138.6,79.9 142.2,78.0 145.9,76.4 149.5,74.9 153.2,73.6 156.8,72.5 160.5,71.5 164.1,70.8 167.8,70.2 171.4,69.8 175.1,69.6 178.7,69.6 182.4,69.8 186.0,70.1 189.7,70.6 193.3,71.3 197.0,72.2 200.6,73.3 204.3,74.6 207.9,76.0 211.6,77.6 215.2,79.4 218.9,81.4 222.5,83.5 226.2,85.9 229.8,88.4 233.5,91.1 237.1,94.0 240.8,97.1 244.4,100.3 248.1,103.8 251.7,107.4 255.4,111.2 259.0,115.2 262.7,119.3 266.3,123.7' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='47.4,180.0 108.9,93.6 170.5,7.2' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='115.8,32.8 191.1,68.0 266.3,103.2' fill='none' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='74.7' cy='141.6' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='80.7' y='151.6'>(0,−1)</text><circle cx='211.6' cy='77.6' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='215.6' y='91.6'>(1,0)</text><circle cx='143.2' cy='45.6' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='149.2' y='39.6'>(1/2, 1/2)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 77.6H294.0M74.7 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='211.6' y1='74.6' x2='211.6' y2='80.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='208.6' y='91.6' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='71.7' y1='141.6' x2='77.7' y2='141.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='58.7' y='145.6' font-size='10'>-1</text></svg></div>\\[A=\\int_0^{1/2}\\bigl(3x-1-f(x)\\bigr)dx+\\int_{1/2}^1\\bigl(-x+1-f(x)\\bigr)dx=\\int_0^{1/2}2x^2\\,dx+\\int_{1/2}^12(x-1)^2\\,dx=\\frac1{12}+\\frac1{12}=\\frac16\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac16\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
